This corpus aggregates and redistributes openly-licensed ancient Greek editions
and is itself licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Component licensing and attribution:

- Aggregated open editions (the bulk of the corpus) come from First1KGreek
  (OpenGreekAndLatin) and Perseus canonical-greekLit, each CC BY-SA 4.0. They are
  redistributed here under the same license. Attribution is due to those projects
  and to the individual editors recorded per work in data/coverage.json. You must
  pass the same CC BY-SA 4.0 terms to any adaptation of these texts.

- Non-commercial (CC BY-NC-SA) and unlicensed texts are excluded from this
  corpus; works available only under such terms are listed in
  data/needs_pd_or_ocr.json and are instead sourced from a public-domain edition.

- OCR of public-domain editions contributed by this project is additionally made
  available under CC BY 4.0.

- Derived statistical tables (per-lemma frequency, coverage counts) are facts and
  carry no copyright; use them freely.

When in doubt about a specific work, consult its entry in data/coverage.json for
the source and license that apply to it.
